  factText: "Mycelium can be turned into fashion like vegan \u201Cleather.\u201D
    Companies grow fungi on trays of sawdust to make sheets of leather-like mycelium.
    After drying and processing, these sheets are dyed and cut into shoes, bags or
    jackets - a flexible, vegan alternative to animal leather."
